+### Source Code (repository root)
+
+Real layout for this feature. `[CHANGE]` marks the only three files touched; nothing else moves.
+
+```text
+plugins/
+├── graphhelm/                          # primary deployment
+│   ├── plugin.json                     # declares serverInfo version "0.1.11", asserted by the test (UNCHANGED)
+│   └── hooks/
+│       ├── task_handoff.py             # [CHANGE] admit object-valued _meta in the tools/call guard
+│       ├── session_hook.py             # imported by task_handoff (host/_id/_session/request binding) (UNCHANGED)
+│       └── test_task_handoff.py        # [CHANGE] add one dedicated _meta contract case; whole suite must pass
+└── graphhelm-codex-hooks/              # Codex companion deployment
+    └── hooks/
+        ├── codex-hooks.json            # (UNCHANGED)
